# One Last Job with its creature and Vehicle modes (CR 608.2b): in response, Bot2 sacrifices Tormod's Crypt to exile Bot1's graveyard,
# so the Savannah Lions and Passenger Ferry it targets are gone (new objects in exile, CR 400.7). With all its targets illegal the
# spell does not resolve at all: nothing returns, the spell is not put onto the battlefield, and it goes to the graveyard as a countered
# spell would. It was paid for exactly, {2}{W} + {2} + {1} = six mana from Black Lotus (white) and three Moxen.

